
----------SDD (Spec driven development)-------------
1.Divide complete feature into sub functional requirements (FR-01, FR-02)
2.Should consider non-functional requirements like- performance, security, scalability, reliability 
3.Define Business rules - constraints that must always be followed
4.define API specifiactions- like its verb type, url, input and output format, response status code etc
5.database specification
6.Acceptance criteria



Step 1 – Requirement gathering

Human

Understand the business requirement and clarify ambiguities.

Step 2 – Generate specification

Human + AI

Use AI to prepare functional requirements, API contracts, business rules and acceptance criteria. Review and approve them.

Step 3 – Technical design

Human + AI

Define architecture, database design, component responsibilities and integration contracts.

Step 4 – Task generation

AI

Break the specification into small implementation tasks.

Step 5 – Code generation

AI + Developer

Generate code task by task, following the approved design.

Step 6 – Validation

AI + Developer

Run tests, perform code reviews and check implementation against acceptance criteria.



